{"text": "9 + 9 = 18\n\nThe core concept behind reinforcement learning for control is trial-and-error learning where an agent learns to take actions by receiving rewards or penalties. Recent developments include data-efficient methods for UAV attitude control. Combining RL with optical flow estimation shows promise in visual navigation tasks, and benchmark datasets like CARLA are used for evaluation. Survey papers on the topic highlight its applications across robotics and autonomous systems.", "token_logprobs": [-0.42672213912010193, -0.007324873469769955, 0.0, -1.4901272152201273e-05, -0.0008978104451671243, 0.0, -2.3841860752327193e-07, 0.0, -0.22429142892360687, -0.7456821203231812, -1.0645215511322021, -0.0020980178378522396, -0.19468456506729126, -0.0003268060681875795, -1.4305124977909145e-06, -9.978315210901201e-05, -9.417578439752106e-06, -0.3627300262451172, -1.6943308115005493, -1.5898125171661377, -0.00028775300597772, -0.0634714812040329, -0.10007811337709427, -0.008182472549378872, -0.00027463631704449654, -0.17432156205177307, -0.049868203699588776, -0.17345428466796875, -0.04812779277563095, -1.25681471824646, -1.0610190629959106, -0.009880196303129196, -0.10071450471878052, -0.02637508697807789, -0.100505031645298, -0.47860172390937805, -0.04654838144779205, -0.04976502060890198, -0.5374431014060974, -0.011641530320048332, -0.3549709618091583, -0.1630050390958786, -0.5912494659423828, -1.6468924283981323, -2.0265599687263602e-06, -0.053570348769426346, -1.0537110567092896, -1.4305124977909145e-06, -0.883954644203186, -0.07287432998418808, -0.00048279494512826204, -6.07969241173123e-06, -0.327381432056427, -1.476959466934204, -0.046471454203128815, -1.3638898134231567, -0.7947652339935303, -0.8485774993896484, -1.1244462728500366, -2.925551652908325, -0.8537068963050842, -0.33305224776268005, -0.021398598328232765, -0.9039877653121948, -1.3117949962615967, -0.0019433893030509353, -1.0096287727355957, -0.6515929698944092, -0.24221056699752808, -0.5100